luation: \n- Q: c8-b7 → checkmate, wins the game instantly.\n- Other moves like pawn pushes or rook moves lose the opportunity to finish.\n- Any other queen move (e.g., c8-a6) may give check but not mate — king could escape to b8 or b7.\n\nReason: Qc8-b7 delivers unavoidable checkmate, ending the game immediately and securing victory.\n\nAnswer: Q: c8-b7'}
