ting a pawn dramatically increases winning chances. The move P: a6-a7 brings me one step from queening (next move a7-a8=Q), while maintaining tension and initiative. It also activates my position, forcing Black to respond rather than consolidate.\n\nAnswer: P: a6-a7'}
